  "description": {
    "text": "The Virizion deck of the Battle Strength Decks, three Japanese half decks released together on 18 March 2011 (Virizion, Terrakion and Cobalion) for players who had learned the game and wanted to battle better. Each held a 30-card half deck and three Battle Strength holo cards to swap in and strengthen it, among them the Legendary Pokémon Virizion and Bianca, the childhood friend from Pokémon Black and White, with a strengthening guide and a quick guide. Darmanitan, Swadloon and Basculin back it up, on Grass, Fire and Water Energy.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: ポケモンカードゲームBW　バトル強化デッキ ビリジオン・テラキオン・コバルオン",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20110213062459/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/bw/bk.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
        "url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9D%E3%82%B1%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E7%99%BA%E5%A3%B2%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%A7"
